 **History and Development:**
-The method builds on 3DGS (Kerbl et al., 2023) and ImprovedGS (Deng et al., 2026). It addresses limitations of existing scalable methods like FlexGS (Liu et al., 2025a), NanoGS (Xiong et al., 2026), and SCAR-GS (Revilla et al., 2026) by explicitly optimizing nested anchors and connecting their states [S1, unofficial].
